The [[Boiling Pot]] is an [[Accessory]] normally obtainable by combining the [[Pan]] with the [[Wooden Buckler]], which are both common items available in the shop for all classes. It synergizes with [[Potion]]s and [[Food]]s, healing when potions are triggered on its right, more when more [[Food]]s are on its left. After a long time, it also grants a large portion of {{icon/heat}} and {{icon/regeneration}}, but this can be sped up the more [[Potion]]s and [[Food]]s are in the appropriate slots.
